      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这种悠闲的时光……真不错呢……\n对我们来说，\n或许这样的生活就已经很足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "599fbcda52b61f9a67d2374e4368456d8fcb470c688695ebac7032dc221fbf9c",
