      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹拉着我的手臂，\n来到渔村外的一条山路的入口。\n在那里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea7fe4c53995cc6827f5dd19acdd91630f61ee7c83cb3707604e9b7f506a625a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
