    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:816213a4d225e8407037eec6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我本以为她会挑个比较时髦的地方，但我想错了。\n于是我们就这样搭巴士换了几班车，\n来到了下雪的渔村。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f97c6c785800b319316bd673a8a27076a9ef9e009fb59883b5be3e5abc64c33e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
